              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "24778229"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Catalyzes the phosphorylation of rifampicin, also known as rifampin (RIF), leading to its inactivation (PubMed:24778229). Confers high level resistance to a variety of clinically used rifamycin antibiotics (PubMed:24778229). Does not show phosphoenolpyruvate (PEP) synthase activity (PubMed:24778229)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "FUNCTION"
    },
