              "id": "24778229"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Disruption mutant fails to inactivate RIF (PubMed:24778229). Mutant displays a modest twofold decrease in RIF minimum inhibitory concentrations (MICs) compared with the wild-type strain (PubMed:24778229)"
        }
